#: index.docbook:240
#, no-c-format
msgid "&help.menu.documentation;"
msgstr "&help.menu.documentation;"

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:247
#, no-c-format
msgid "Information for Developers and Advanced Users"
msgstr "Informazón para Desenvolventes e Usuários Avanzados"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:248
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"&kfortune; features, like many other &kde; applications as well, a &DCOP; "
"interface which makes it possible to control a part of it's functionality from "
"&eg; a shellscript."
msgstr ""
"&kfortune;, como moitos outros programas de &kde;, fornece unha interface &DCOP; "
"que permite controlar unha parte da sua funcionalidade desde &eg; un guión da shell."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:251
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"To use these &DCOP; functions you can either use the <command>dcop</command> "
"commandline program or the more convenient <application>Kdcop</application> "
"application. Both provide the same functionality so it's mostly a matter of "
"taste and context of usage when deciding which way to choose."
msgstr ""
"Para usar estas funzóns &DCOP; pode ou usar o programa para a liña de comandos "
"<command>dcop</command> ou mellor o programa <application>Kdcop</application>. "
"Ambos os dous fornecen a mesma funcionalidade polo que a escolla é mais ben "
"unha cousa de gostos e de ámbito de uso."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:256
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"This chapter assumes that you're using the <command>dcop</command> "
"commandline program. To access &kfortune;'s &DCOP; functions, make sure that "
"&kfortune; is <link linkend=\"starting\">started</link> "
"and then enter something like this at a console:"
msgstr ""
"Este capítulo asume que está a usar o programa <command>dcop</command>. "
"Para aceder ás función &DCOP; de &kfortune;, certifique-se de que &kfortune; está "
"<link linkend=\"starting\">a ser executado</link> e logo introduza algo como isto "
"na consola:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:260
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>dcop</command> <option>"
"kfortune-X</option> <option>KFortuneWindow</option> <option>[function]</option>"
"</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>dcop</command> <option>"
"kfortune-X</option> <option>KFortuneWindow</option> <option>[funzón]</option>"
"</userinput>"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:263
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"If an error message appears telling you that <command>dcop</command> "
"couldn't be found or executed, please ensure that the <command>dcop</command> "
"binary is in <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/bin</filename> "
"and that that directory is in your $<envar>PATH</envar>"
". Also, make sure the permissions for that file are appropriately set (that "
"your user can execute that file)."
msgstr ""
"Se aparece unha mensaxe de erro dicindo-lle que non foi posíbel atopar ou executar "
"o comando <command>dcop</command>, asegure-se de que o executábel "
"<command>dcop</command> está en  <filename class=\"directory\">$<envar>KDEDIR</envar>/bin</filename> e de que ese "
"directório está no seu $<envar>PATH</envar>. Asegure-se tamén de que os "
"permisos para tal ficheiro son os correctos (que o seu usuário pode executar o ficheiro)."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:271
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"In that command line, just replace <quote>X</quote> with the actual number of "
"the &kfortune; process and <quote>[function]</quote> "
"with the respective name of the function you'd like to call."
msgstr ""
"Nesa liña de comandos, simplesmente substitua <quote>X</quote> polo número "
"real do proceso de &kfortune; e <quote>[funzón]</quote> co nome da funzón "
"á que desexa chamar."

#. Tag: title
#: index.docbook:276
#, no-c-format
msgid "&DCOP; Interface Reference"
msgstr "Referéncia da Interface &DCOP;"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:277
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"Besides the generic &DCOP; functions available to all &kde; programs, "
"&kfortune; features the following functions which are specific to it."
msgstr ""
"Ademais das funzóns xenéricas de &DCOP; disponíbeis en todos os programas de &kde;,"
"&kfortune; oferece as seguintes funzóns que son próprias del."

#. Tag: command
#: index.docbook:282
#, no-c-format
msgid "currentFortune"
msgstr "currentFortune"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:284
#, no-c-format
msgid "Returns the currently shown fortune text."
msgstr "Devolve o texto da frase que se está a mostrar."

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:285 index.docbook:293
#, no-c-format
msgid "Example:"
msgstr "Exemplo:"

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:286
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>echo</command> `<option>"
"kfortune-31754</option> <option>KFortuneWindow</option> <option>"
"currentFortune</option>`</userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>dcop</command> <option>"
"kfortune-31754</option> <option>KFortuneWindow</option> <option>"
"currentFortune</option></userinput>"

#. Tag: command
#: index.docbook:290
#, no-c-format
msgid "nextFortune"
msgstr "nextFortune"

#. Tag: para
#: index.docbook:292
#, no-c-format
msgid "Instructs &kfortune; to show another fortune."
msgstr "Ordena-lle a &kfortune; mostrar outra frase."

#. Tag: screen
#: index.docbook:294
#, no-c-format
msgid ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>dcop</command> <option>"
"kfortune-31754</option> <option>KFortuneWindow</option> <option>"
"nextFortune</option></userinput>"
msgstr ""
"<prompt>%</prompt> <userinput><command>dcop</command> <option>"
"kfortune-31754</option> <option>KFortuneWindow</option> <option>"
"nextFortune</option></userinput>"

